"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>. Under <b class="gd-ui">Messages</b>, choose <b class="gd-ui">Email</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Text</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Both</b>. It is saved at once.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Texts go to the phone you verified with a code (Sign-in, above). Until you verify one, we email you.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Signed agreements, statements and receipts are always emailed when we have your email. On Text you also get a text with a link to view or download them.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">No texts from 9 pm to 8 am, except urgent ones such as a late return. Reply STOP to any text to stop texts (we confirm with one text); text START to turn them back on.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>You can also choose in the booking request (How should we reach you?) and when you sign up with your phone number, where Text is chosen for you.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-rewards" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Rewards</h2><p class="gd-p">Open <b class="gd-ui">Rewards</b> in your account.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Every rental earns 1 point per dollar of the rental charge when it closes. 100 points are worth $1 off the rental charge of a later booking.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">More ways to earn are listed on the page: refer a friend with your link (you both get points at their first rental), follow us, review your rental on carmacars.ca, review us on Google (press <b class="gd-ui">I posted my review</b> and give the name on it), a damage-free rental, your birthday and your first rental.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Get my code</b> turns points into a code of your own, from 500 points. Type it in the promo code box of your request. An unused code can be given back for the points.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Rent 10 days in 12 months for Silver (5% off) and 30 for Gold (10% off): your tier code is on the page.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Points end 12 months after your last rental or redemption. We email you a month before.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-your-trip-in-your-calendar-or-wallet" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your trip in your calendar or wallet</h2><p class="gd-p">On a confirmed booking, <b class="gd-ui">Add to calendar</b> adds the pickup and the return. The confirmation email has the same link. <b class="gd-ui">Add to Apple Wallet</b> shows when it is available.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-phone-alerts" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Phone alerts</h2><p class="gd-p">Get an alert on your phone or computer when your offer is ready, before pickup and return, for payments and when we message you, even with CarmaCars closed.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>. Under <b class="gd-ui">Phone alerts</b>, press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on alerts</b> and allow notifications when your browser asks.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Under <b class="gd-ui">What to alert me about</b>, untick anything you do not want. Your choice applies to all your devices.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Send a test alert</b> to see one. <b class="gd-ui">Turn off on this device</b> stops them there; <b class="gd-ui">Remove</b> takes another device off.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first: in Safari tap <b class="gd-ui">Share</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>. Open CarmaCars from your Home Screen, sign in and turn alerts on in Profile (iOS 16.4 or later).</p><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>Alerts come as well as your emails and texts, never instead of them. Alerts that are not urgent wait until 8 am. Sign-in links and codes never come as alerts.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-delete-my-account" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Delete my account</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b> and scroll to <b class="gd-ui">Delete my account</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Delete my account</b>, add a reason if you like, then <b class="gd-ui">Yes, delete my account</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">We settle anything still open (a rental, a deposit), delete your account and email you within 30 days. Changed your mind before then? Press <b class="gd-ui">Keep my account</b>.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>We keep rental agreements, receipts and tax records as the law requires. Everything else, including your licence and selfie photos, is deleted.</div></aside></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('renter', 'quick-reference', 'reference', 'after-your-trip', '### Where things are

| Item | What it is for |
| --- | --- |
| **Trips** | Your next trip with its photo and next step, then upcoming and past trips |
| **Documents** | Agreements, receipts, statements, uploads |
| **Notifications** | Notices and your email choices |
| **Profile** | Contact details, drivers, Card on File |

### Top tasks

1. *Request a car:* **Find a car**, the car, then **Request to book**
2. *Approve an offer:* **Trips** > **Review offer** > **Approve and continue**
3. *Sign and pay:* **All four**, **Sign and continue to payment**, then **Pay $...**
4. *Upload documents:* **Your booking** > **Licence and coverage**
5. *Extend or change dates:* **Extend** or **Ask to change dates**
6. *Answer a change we suggest:* **Review and answer**
7. *Cancel:* **Your booking** > **Cancel booking**
8. *Review your trip:* **Review your rental**

### If something goes wrong

| What you see | What to do |
| --- | --- |
| **A link says it expired** | Links in our emails work for 24 hours, once. Press **Send me a new link** on that page. |
| **"Error 1102" on a page** | A short limit on our web host. Reload the page. You are still signed in. |
| **"That email and password do not match an account."** | Check the address, or use **Set a new password** on the sign-in page. |
| **"This car was just taken"** | Someone confirmed first. Your card is released; pick from the car or dates we offer. |
| **No confirmation email** | Check spam, then use **Send the confirmation link again** on the sign-in form. |
