![](/guides/img/owner-15-profile-desktop-874dd23d.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 872; address: carmacars.ca/owner/profile; pins: 1 12.2 84.7, 2 73.4 21.2")

## Texts or email

On **Account** > **Profile**, under **Messages**, choose **Email**, **Text** or **Both**: new bookings, payouts, invoices and documents to sign by a short text with a link. Texts need a phone you verified with a code. Statements, invoices and signed documents are always emailed too. Reply STOP to any text to stop them.

