1. Open **Account** > **Profile**. Under **Phone alerts**, press **Turn on alerts** and allow notifications when your browser asks.
2. Under **What to alert me about**, choose the topics. Your choice applies to all your devices.
3. **Send a test alert** shows one. **Turn off on this device** stops them there; **Remove** takes another device off.

On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, **Share**, **Add to Home Screen**), then open it from there and turn alerts on. Alerts that are not urgent wait until 8 am.

## Delete my account

**Profile**, **Delete my account**, then **Yes, delete my account**. We settle your cars, payouts and invoices first (a car under your agreement leaves the program with 30 days'' notice), then delete your account and email you. **Keep my account** withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.',
  '<p class="gd-p">Keep your details up to date, read our notices, and know how to take a car out of the program.</p><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-notifications" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Notifications</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Account &gt; Notifications lists our messages: new bookings, changes to a booking, payments and listing news, with your email preferences beside them.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Mark as read</b> on one, or <b class="gd-ui">Mark all as read</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/owner/notifications</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/692"><img src="/guides/img/owner-14-notifications-desktop-8e58b95e.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="692"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:20.1%;top:22.7%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-your-profile" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your profile</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Update your email, phone and address, then press Save.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">On your agreements shows your legal name and how you are enrolled. A change to these means new agreements, so call or message us.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/owner/profile</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/872"><img src="/guides/img/owner-15-profile-desktop-874dd23d.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="872"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:12.2%;top:84.7%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:73.4%;top:21.2%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-texts-or-email" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Texts or email</h2><p class="gd-p">On <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, under <b class="gd-ui">Messages</b>, choose <b class="gd-ui">Email</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Text</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Both</b>: new bookings, payouts, invoices and documents to sign by a short text with a link. Texts need a phone you verified with a code. Statements, invoices and signed documents are always emailed too. Reply STOP to any text to stop them.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-take-a-car-out-of-the-program" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Take a car out of the program</h2><p class="gd-p">You give 30 days&#39; notice for that car only. Your other cars stay in.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open Cars and the car. Read Leaving: when the notice ends and what happens to your last fees.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Give notice</b>. Add a Reason (optional).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Give exit notice</b>. The car&#39;s page then shows its exit date.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-phone-alerts" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Phone alerts</h2><p class="gd-p">Get an alert on your phone or computer when one of your cars is booked, when a booking changes, for payouts and payments, incidents and documents to sign.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>. Under <b class="gd-ui">Phone alerts</b>, press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on alerts</b> and allow notifications when your browser asks.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Under <b class="gd-ui">What to alert me about</b>, choose the topics. Your choice applies to all your devices.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Send a test alert</b> shows one. <b class="gd-ui">Turn off on this device</b> stops them there; <b class="gd-ui">Remove</b> takes another device off.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, <b class="gd-ui">Share</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>), then open it from there and turn alerts on. Alerts that are not urgent wait until 8 am.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-delete-my-account" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Delete my account</h2><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Delete my account</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Yes, delete my account</b>. We settle your cars, payouts and invoices first (a car under your agreement leaves the program with 30 days&#39; notice), then delete your account and email you. <b class="gd-ui">Keep my account</b> withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('owner', 'quick-reference', 'reference', 'notices-profile-and-leaving', '### Where things are

| Item | What it is for |
| --- | --- |
| **Home** | Next thing to do, your cars, money, next debit |
| **Vehicles** | Each car: terms, checklist, uploads, photos, Leaving |
| **Bookings** | All bookings, the calendar, Book my own car |
| **Money** | **Invoices** (fee invoices and Pay $...), **Statements** (one a month, Download PDF), **Payouts** (what was paid and when) |
| **Documents** | Agreements, forms, Forms C and D |
| **Account** | **Profile** (contact details, password), **Banking** (automatic debit, where we pay you), **Notifications** (our messages) |

### Top tasks

1. *Sign everything at once:* **Home** > **Check and sign**
2. *Set up the monthly debit:* **Account** > **Banking** > **Set up pre-authorized debit**
3. *Pay an invoice now:* **Money** > **Invoices**, the invoice, then **Pay $...**
4. *Payout details:* **Account** > **Banking** > **Where we pay you**
5. *Forms C and D:* **Documents** > **Sign Form C on screen instead** or **Take a photo of the signed page**
6. *Book your own car:* **Bookings** > **Book my own car**
7. *New listing photos:* **Vehicles**, the car, then **Take new photos**
8. *Leave the program:* **Vehicles**, the car, then **Give notice**

### If something goes wrong

| What you see | What to do |
| --- | --- |
| **A link says it expired** | Links in our emails work for 24 hours, once. Press **Send me a new link** on that page. |
| **"Error 1102" on a page** | A short limit on our web host. Reload the page. You are still signed in. |
| **"That email and password do not match an account."** | Check the address, or use **Set a new password** on the sign-in page. |
| **A debit was returned** | You get an email with the reason. Insufficient funds: keep the money in the account for the retry, or pay the invoice from its page. Any other reason: pay from the invoice''s page or set up a new account under Account > Banking. |
