  '<p class="gd-p">The investor deck tells the CarmaCars story in slides: the problem we solve, how the business makes money, every feature of the platform with its real screen, the investment offer, its risks, and how your Return builds.</p><section class="gd-task" id="the-investor-deck-open-the-deck" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Open the deck</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On <b class="gd-ui">Home</b>, press <b class="gd-ui">Open the deck</b>, or press <b class="gd-ui">Investor deck</b> in the menu.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Above the slides, <b class="gd-ui">Watch the deck</b> plays the whole deck, narrated, in a few minutes, with captions in the player (it is there once CarmaCars has published the video).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Move with <b class="gd-ui">Previous</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Next</b>, the arrow keys, or a swipe left or right on a phone. The list at the top jumps to any slide.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Download PDF</b> to save or print it: each slide prints on its own landscape page.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="the-investor-deck-the-calculator" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The calculator</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Enter an amount (at least the minimum investment) and choose <b class="gd-ui">Paid monthly</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Reinvested</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Reinvest, then paid</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Choose how many years to show and the Investment Date.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">You see when the lockup ends, your first payment date, what a full month pays, what is paid to you for the period, and your Invested Amount at the end, with a chart and a month-by-month table.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">The calculator follows your agreement exactly: no Return for the lockup, then one twelfth of the Yearly Percentage on the Invested Amount each month, by days for a part month, paid on the 15th of the next month or added to the Invested Amount at month end.</p><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>The examples use the yearly percentage of our current offer. Your own percentage is the one in your agreement. Every example and figure in the deck is an illustration, not a forecast or a promise, and is not part of any offering memorandum.</div></aside></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('investor', 'profile-and-notices', 'chapter', 'statements', 'Your contact details, and the notices you can send us: how returns are handled, your bank account, and a transfer request.

## Contact details

Contact details shows your name, email, phone, address and bank account on file. To update these, ask us; we confirm by phone.

## Change how returns are handled

1. Under How returns are handled, choose Paid monthly or Reinvested.
2. Press **Send the notice**. The change applies from the first Return Month that starts at least 10 days after we receive it.

![](/guides/img/investor-04-profile-phone-5e6b0e83.jpg "phone; size: 390 170")

## Bank account and transfers

1. To change the account we pay, press **Ask to change the bank account**. We call you at the number on file to take the new details. A change applies 10 days after notice.
2. To transfer an investment, choose it, fill in To (full name) and a Note, then press **Send the request**. A transfer needs CarmaCars'' written consent.
3. You see "Received. CarmaCars will confirm in writing." We confirm each request by email.

## Two-step sign-in (recommended)

1. At the bottom of Profile and notices, press **Set up two-step sign-in**.
2. Scan the code with your authenticator app.
3. Type the 6 digits and press **Continue**. From then on, every sign-in asks for a code.

Documents, further down the same page, lists your statements as files.

## Phone alerts

Get an alert on your phone or computer when a return is paid, a statement is ready or we send you a notice. Open **Profile**, then under **Phone alerts** press **Turn on alerts** and allow notifications. Choose the topics under **What to alert me about**. On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, **Share**, **Add to Home Screen**) and turn alerts on from there.

## Delete my account

**Profile**, **Delete my account**, then **Yes, delete my account**. An investment still under contract is settled first, as your agreement says; then we delete your account and email you. **Keep my account** withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.', 'Account', 'Contact details, notices about returns and bank account, transfers, two-step sign-in.',
  'Your contact details, and the notices you can send us: how returns are handled, your bank account, and a transfer request.

## Contact details

Contact details shows your name, email, phone, address and bank account on file. To update these, ask us; we confirm by phone.

## Change how returns are handled

1. Under How returns are handled, choose Paid monthly or Reinvested.
2. Press **Send the notice**. The change applies from the first Return Month that starts at least 10 days after we receive it.

![](/guides/img/investor-04-profile-phone-5e6b0e83.jpg "phone; size: 390 170")

## Bank account and transfers

1. To change the account we pay, press **Ask to change the bank account**. We call you at the number on file to take the new details. A change applies 10 days after notice.
2. To transfer an investment, choose it, fill in To (full name) and a Note, then press **Send the request**. A transfer needs CarmaCars'' written consent.
3. You see "Received. CarmaCars will confirm in writing." We confirm each request by email.

## Two-step sign-in (recommended)

1. At the bottom of Account, press **Set up two-step sign-in**.
2. Scan the code with your authenticator app.
3. Type the 6 digits and press **Continue**. From then on, every sign-in asks for a code.

Documents, further down the same page, lists your statements as files.

## Phone alerts

Get an alert on your phone or computer when a return is paid, a statement is ready or we send you a notice. Open **Account**, then under **Phone alerts** press **Turn on alerts** and allow notifications. Choose the topics under **What to alert me about**. On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, **Share**, **Add to Home Screen**) and turn alerts on from there.

## Delete my account

**Account**, **Delete my account**, then **Yes, delete my account**. An investment still under contract is settled first, as your agreement says; then we delete your account and email you. **Keep my account** withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.
',
  '<p class="gd-p">Your contact details, and the notices you can send us: how returns are handled, your bank account, and a transfer request.</p><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-contact-details" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Contact details</h2><p class="gd-p">Contact details shows your name, email, phone, address and bank account on file. To update these, ask us; we confirm by phone.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-change-how-returns-are-handled" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Change how returns are handled</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Under How returns are handled, choose Paid monthly or Reinvested.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Send the notice</b>. The change applies from the first Return Month that starts at least 10 days after we receive it.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/170"><img src="/guides/img/investor-04-profile-phone-5e6b0e83.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="170"></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-bank-account-and-transfers" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Bank account and transfers</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">To change the account we pay, press <b class="gd-ui">Ask to change the bank account</b>. We call you at the number on file to take the new details. A change applies 10 days after notice.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">To transfer an investment, choose it, fill in To (full name) and a Note, then press <b class="gd-ui">Send the request</b>. A transfer needs CarmaCars&#39; written consent.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">You see &quot;Received. CarmaCars will confirm in writing.&quot; We confirm each request by email.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-two-step-sign-in-recommended" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Two-step sign-in (recommended)</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">At the bottom of Account, press <b class="gd-ui">Set up two-step sign-in</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Scan the code with your authenticator app.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Type the 6 digits and press <b class="gd-ui">Continue</b>. From then on, every sign-in asks for a code.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">Documents, further down the same page, lists your statements as files.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-phone-alerts" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Phone alerts</h2><p class="gd-p">Get an alert on your phone or computer when a return is paid, a statement is ready or we send you a notice. Open <b class="gd-ui">Account</b>, then under <b class="gd-ui">Phone alerts</b> press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on alerts</b> and allow notifications. Choose the topics under <b class="gd-ui">What to alert me about</b>. On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, <b class="gd-ui">Share</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>) and turn alerts on from there.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-delete-my-account" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Delete my account</h2><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Account</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Delete my account</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Yes, delete my account</b>. An investment still under contract is settled first, as your agreement says; then we delete your account and email you. <b class="gd-ui">Keep my account</b> withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('investor', 'keeping-your-account-safe', 'chapter', 'profile-and-notices', 'Your portal holds your investment records. A few habits keep it yours.

## Good habits

| Habit | Why |
| --- | --- |
| Sign out on shared computers | **Sign out** is at the top of every page. It signs you out on this device only. |
| Email links work once | Invitation and password links work for 24 hours, once. Never forward them. |
| Two-step sign-in | With it on, a password alone cannot open your portal. Set it up under Profile and notices. |
| We never ask for your password | CarmaCars never asks for your password or a sign-in code by email or phone. |
| Bank changes are confirmed by phone | We call the number on file before we change where returns are paid. |

## Signed in with the wrong account?

If a page says "You are signed in as ..." and that you have no access, you are signed in with another CarmaCars account (for example a renter account). Press **Sign out**, then sign in with the email your invitation was sent to.
', 'Keeping your account safe', 'Signing out, email links, two-step sign-in and the wrong account.',
