  '<p class="gd-p">Your portal holds your investment records. A few habits keep it yours.</p><section class="gd-task" id="keeping-your-account-safe-good-habits" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Good habits</h2><div class="gd-tablewrap"><table class="gd-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Habit</th><th scope="col">Why</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sign out on shared computers</td><td><b class="gd-ui">Sign out</b> is at the top of every page. It signs you out on this device only.</td></tr><tr><td>Email links work once</td><td>Invitation and password links work for 24 hours, once. Never forward them.</td></tr><tr><td>Two-step sign-in</td><td>With it on, a password alone cannot open your portal. Set it up under Account.</td></tr><tr><td>We never ask for your password</td><td>CarmaCars never asks for your password or a sign-in code by email or phone.</td></tr><tr><td>Bank changes are confirmed by phone</td><td>We call the number on file before we change where returns are paid.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="keeping-your-account-safe-signed-in-with-the-wrong-account" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Signed in with the wrong account?</h2><p class="gd-p">If a page says &quot;You are signed in as ...&quot; and that you have no access, you are signed in with another CarmaCars account (for example a renter account). Press <b class="gd-ui">Sign out</b>, then sign in with the email your invitation was sent to.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('investor', 'quick-reference', 'reference', 'keeping-your-account-safe', '### Where things are

| Item | What it is for |
| --- | --- |
| **Investments** | Each investment, returns, next payment |
| **Statements** | One per month; PDF, ZIP and CSV by year |
| **Profile and notices** | Contact details, notices, transfers, two-step sign-in |

### Top tasks

1. *See what you earned:* **Statements**, then a month
2. *Keep a statement:* **Download PDF**
3. *A whole year:* **Statements** > **Download a year**
4. *Paid monthly or reinvested:* **Send the notice**
5. *Change your bank account:* **Ask to change the bank account**
6. *Transfer an investment:* **Send the request**
7. *Protect your account:* **Set up two-step sign-in**

### If something goes wrong

| What you see | What to do |
| --- | --- |
| **A link says it expired** | Links in our emails work for 24 hours, once. Press **Send me a new link** on that page. |
| **"Error 1102" on a page** | A short limit on our web host. Reload the page. You are still signed in. |
| **"That email and password do not match an account."** | Check the address, or use **Set a new password** on the sign-in page. |
| **Asked for a 6-digit code** | Open your authenticator app. Lost your phone? Call us. |
', 'Quick reference', 'One page with the essentials.',
